          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:0",
          "start": 0
        },
        "quote": "(a) No vehicle shall be towed away or otherwise taken into possession or custody by members of the Police Department unless and until the owner or person in possession of the private property on which the vehicle is abandoned shall sign a complaint and a hold-harmless agreement. The signing of the complaint shall be deemed conclusive of the complainant’s consent and promise to pay the costs of towing or removing the vehicle and the reasonable storage charges therefor if the complaint is withdrawn by the complainant or is found to have been made by mistake or error or if the vehicle is not claimed and the City is not otherwise reimbursed for such towing or removing or storage charges, in which latter event, the complainant shall be deemed liable to the City, as concerns towing, removing and storage costs, only to the extent the City is not so reimbursed.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.25.030 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "a65e11f5-8eab-59a0-8c04-3aa48307f804",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 971,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:1",
          "start": 866
        },
        "quote": "(b) The purpose of the hold-harmless agreement required by this section shall be to make the complainant:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.25.030 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "649c2acc-31bd-5ee7-bf59-6c064e2e5708",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1395,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:2",
          "start": 972
        },
        "quote": "(1) Primarily liable, instead of the City, and to exonerate the City and hold it blameless and without liability to any person on account of any injuries or damages or other cause of action that might accrue to the owner of the vehicle or to any other person arising out of the towing, removing, storing or the taking and during the period of possession or custody of the vehicle by the City or its employees or agents; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.25.030 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "b47b0386-c781-579e-9052-c40f032c5461",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1794,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:3",
          "start": 1396
        },
        "quote": "(2) Liable to indemnify and reimburse the City for any and all expenses and costs, including reasonable attorneys’ fees and all costs in defending lawsuits incurred by the City because of any alleged or actual liability to any person imposed on the City and arising out of any of such acts of towing, removing, storing or the taking and during the period of possession or custody of such a vehicle.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.25.030 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "86682752-0b03-52bf-8d8b-5a79e57694e3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1958,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:4",
          "start": 1795
        },
        "quote": "(c) The hold-harmless agreement required by this section shall in essence contain the following information in such form as shall be approved by the City Attorney:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.25.030 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "2b14a573-ecdd-561f-97b7-3b9d6de9c5ad",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1990,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:5",
          "start": 1959
        },
        "quote": "(1) Description of the vehicle;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.25.030 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "b40409ee-7896-5667-b38c-ef3aa62d2cd6",
