          "end": 2015,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:6",
          "start": 1991
        },
        "quote": "(2) Date of abandonment;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.25.030 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "c9dedea2-4130-551b-99f3-6c2fdcebda98",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2056,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:7",
          "start": 2016
        },
        "quote": "(3) Address of the place of abandonment;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.25.030 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "6c7f9163-f92a-5c3f-8764-8962876c9d0c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2162,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:8",
          "start": 2057
        },
        "quote": "(4) Name of the owner or person in lawful possession of the property upon which the vehicle is abandoned;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.25.030 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "c8fbabb0-c6c3-5246-947d-c6f1d0af0e0a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2232,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:9",
          "start": 2163
        },
        "quote": "(5) Name of the principal for whom an agent is acting, if applicable;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.25.030 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "10c1b6c5-8b8a-5ffa-a5b8-3d02e664674a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2354,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:10",
          "start": 2233
        },
        "quote": "(6) An acknowledgment that the complaining party assumes all liabilities which may accrue by the removal of the property;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.25.030 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "9430f6a6-4ea2-5afa-88cf-a0bb64514d54",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2531,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:11",
          "start": 2355
        },
        "quote": "(7) An acknowledgment by the complaining party that he or the principal for whom he acts assumes primary liability for any actions arising from the removal of the property; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.25.030 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "c2d86c02-4ad1-5007-9bbd-803606c905be",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2900,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:12",
          "start": 2532
        },
        "quote": "(8) An acknowledgment that the complaining party or the principal for whom he acts expressly promises and agrees to indemnify and reimburse the City for all expenses, costs, reasonable attorney fees and costs in defending lawsuits incurred by the City because of any such alleged or actual liability arising from the removal. (Code 1981 § 43-404. Code 1995 § 142-268.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.25.030:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
